      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.bloodthirsty": "Bloodthirsty",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.bloodthirsty.desc": "§7• §eBloodthirsty: §fHeals the wielder for 15% of damage dealt per level.",
