      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.rocket_blast": "Rocket Blast",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.rocket_blast.desc": "§7• §eRocket Blast: §fUsing a firework while gliding adds an immediate strong boost and pushes nearby mobs.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scatter": "Scatter",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scatter.desc": "§7• §eScatter: §fEach bow shot creates four extra arrows in a widening fan.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scooping": "Scooping",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scooping.desc": "§7• §eScooping: §fScoops out whole patches of dirt, gravel and sand at once.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.scorching_bath": "Scorching Bath",
