      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.slide": "Slide",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.slide.desc": "§7• §eSlide: §fWhile sprinting, grants Speed based on the strongest of E-Speed, Dash, Strafe and Slide.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.slow_heavy_weakness": "Sluggish Weakness",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.slow_heavy_weakness.desc": "§7• §eSluggish Weakness: §fHits inflict slowness and weakness.",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sniper": "Sniper",
      "enchantment.deep_lucky_block.sniper.desc": "§7• §eSniper: §fArrows deal more damage with distance.",
