      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.meteor_stomp.desc": "§7• §eMeteor Stomp: §fLanding on enemies crushes them like a meteor.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mighty_strike": "Mighty Strike",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mighty_strike.desc": "§7• §eMighty Strike: §f+1.2 damage per level with extra knockback.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.military_shovel": "Military Shovel",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.military_shovel.desc": "§7• §eMilitary Shovel: §fGreatly increases mining speed while using a shovel.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.miners_guidance": "Miner\u0027s Eye",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.miners_guidance.desc": "§7• §eMiner\u0027s Eye: §fTracks nearby eligible ore veins with 5-block colour-coded rays that update every 0.25 seconds. Rays begin 1.35 blocks around your body: particles start very small (0.30 scale) and progressively grow to normal size (1.15) toward the ore direction. The bright End Rod core begins after 1.5 blocks so nothing large covers the camera. Distance remains the main selection factor and no chat text is shown.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mining_stability": "Mining Stability",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mining_stability.desc": "§7• §eMining Stability: §fStabilizes nearby sand, red sand and unsupported gravel into solid blocks.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.molten": "Molten",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.molten.desc": "§7• §eMolten: §fAutomatically smelts mined ores, compatible with Fortune.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.momentum": "Momentum",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.momentum.desc": "§7• §eMomentum: §fMaintaining a grounded sprint builds charge. After 0.6 seconds it grants Speed, ramping up every 25 ticks to the enchantment level; charge quickly decays when you stop.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.monster_fishing": "Monster Fishing",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.monster_fishing.desc": "§7• §eMonster Fishing: §fSuccessful catches may pull a living aquatic creature instead of only loot.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.multishot_bow": "Multishot",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.multishot_bow.desc": "§7• §eMultishot: §fFires extra arrows with every shot.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mystic_mind": "Mystic Mind",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.mystic_mind.desc": "§7• §eMystic Mind: §fGrants 2 experience points per level every 10 seconds.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.nether_corrosion": "Nether Corrosion",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.nether_corrosion.desc": "§7• §cNether Corrosion: §fIn the Nether, this item\u0027s durability decays.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.nether_curse": "Nether Curse",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.nether_curse.desc": "§7• §cNether Curse: §fIn the Nether, multiplies weapon damage by 0.4; in other dimensions, multiplies it by 1.3.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.new_edge": "New Edge",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.new_edge.desc": "§7• §eNew Edge: §f+1% damage for every 1% durability remaining (+100% at full durability).",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.night_veil": "Night Veil",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.night_veil.desc": "§7• §eNight Veil: §fWhile sneaking, refreshes Night Vision for 30 seconds.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.noise_disturbance": "Noise Disturbance",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.noise_disturbance.desc": "§7• §cNoise Disturbance: §fApplies Weakness for 3 seconds every second while worn.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.normal_crit_damage": "Critical Damage Boost",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.normal_crit_damage.desc": "§7• §eCritical Damage Boost: §fCriticals deal +20% damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ocean_current": "Ocean Current",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ocean_current.desc": "§7• §eOcean Current: §fA thrown enchanted trident is empowered in water or rain; underwater impacts deal 2 bonus damage per level and pull nearby aquatic creatures.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oceans_blessing": "Ocean\u0027s Blessing",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oceans_blessing.desc": "§7• §eOcean\u0027s Blessing: §fWhile in water, incoming damage is reduced by 40%.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ore_detector": "Ore Detector",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.ore_detector.desc": "§7• §eOre Detector: §fRight-click with a Nether Star in hand to count nearby ores.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.overclocked_crit": "Overclocked Crit",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.overclocked_crit.desc": "§7• §eOverclocked Crit: §fCriticals deal +100% damage per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.overworld_curse": "Overworld Curse",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.overworld_curse.desc": "§7• §cOverworld Curse: §fIn the Overworld, multiplies weapon damage by 0.4; in other dimensions, multiplies it by 1.3.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oxygen_hover": "Oxygen Hover",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oxygen_hover.desc": "§7• §eOxygen Hover: §fWhile sneaking, sets vertical velocity to zero and holds you at the same height.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oxygen_lack_haste": "Hypoxia Haste",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oxygen_lack_haste.desc": "§7• §eHypoxia Haste: §fGrants bursts of mining Haste and sprint speed.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oxygen_sprint": "Oxygen Sprint",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.oxygen_sprint.desc": "§7• §eOxygen Sprint: §fAdds to your sprint-speed enchantment total while sprinting.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pain_devour": "Pain Devour",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pain_devour.desc": "§7• §ePain Devour: §fTaking damage restores 2 hunger points per level, up to a full hunger bar.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.panic_escape": "Panic Escape",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.panic_escape.desc": "§7• §ePanic Escape: §fGetting hurt triggers a burst of speed.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pebblekin": "Pebblekin",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.pebblekin.desc": "§7• §ePebblekin: §fEnder pearl teleports no longer hurt you.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.peerless": "Peerless",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.peerless.desc": "§7• §ePeerless: §fMasterwork damage: adds 4 damage per level, then multiplies total damage by +50% per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.perception": "Perception",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.perception.desc": "§7• §ePerception: §fEvery 2 seconds, makes mobs within 24 blocks glow for 3 seconds.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.peregrine": "Peregrine",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.peregrine.desc": "§7• §ePeregrine: §fIf the target is below you, adds 0.5 damage per vertical block per level, counting up to 20 blocks.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.perfect_parry": "Perfect Parry",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.perfect_parry.desc": "§7• §ePerfect Parry: §fRaising the shield just before impact strongly slows and pushes the attacker away.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.phantom_bee_vex_aversion": "Phantom, Bee \u0026 Vex Aversion",
