      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.phantom_step": "Phantom Step",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.phantom_step.desc": "§7• §ePhantom Step: §fAfter 4 seconds without attacking, sneaking grants Invisibility and clears nearby mob targets.",
