      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.plunder_wealth": "Plunder Wealth",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.plunder_wealth.desc": "§7• §ePlunder Wealth: §fDefeating Villagers or Pillagers drops emeralds.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.point_shoot": "Point Shoot",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.point_shoot.desc": "§7• §ePoint Shoot: §fForces arrows onto a perfectly straight, accurate initial trajectory.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.poison_arrow": "Poison Arrow",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.poison_arrow.desc": "§7• §ePoison Arrow: §fCreates a short poison cloud at the impact point.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.poison_fang": "Poison Fang",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.poison_fang.desc": "§7• §ePoison Fang: §fEvery melee hit applies Poison; duration is 3 seconds plus 2 seconds per level, up to Poison II.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.poison_scar": "Poison Scar",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.poison_scar.desc": "§7• §ePoison Scar: §fEvery melee hit applies Poison for 5 seconds; level increases the amplifier.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.powerful_thorns": "Powerful Thorns",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.powerful_thorns.desc": "§7• §ePowerful Thorns: §fAttackers take heavy reflected damage.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.predator": "Predator",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.predator.desc": "§7• §ePredator: §fAgainst an isolated target with no other nearby living creature, increases damage by 20% per level.",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.priests_blessing": "Priest\u0027s Blessing",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.priests_blessing.desc": "§7• §ePriest\u0027s Blessing: §fEvery second, removes Poison, Wither, Weakness and Slowness.",
