      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.rocket_blast": "Rocket Blast",
      "enchantment.supreme_lucky_block.rocket_blast.desc": "§7• §eRocket Blast: §fUsing a firework while gliding adds an immediate strong boost and pushes nearby mobs.",
